<library>
<description>&lt;b&gt;EA DOGXL240W-7 240x128 COG LCD Display&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Display Visions / Electronic Assembly&lt;br&gt;
240x128 FSTN, UC1611S controller, SPI/I2C, 3.3V&lt;br&gt;
40-pin SIP connector, 2.54mm pitch&lt;p&gt;
&lt;author&gt;Created for ebike_ctrl project&lt;/author&gt;</description>
