<deviceset name="EA-DOGXL240W-7" prefix="LCD">
<description>&lt;b&gt;EA DOGXL240W-7 240x128 COG LCD Display&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Display Visions / Electronic Assembly&lt;br&gt;
240x128 FSTN Positive Transflective, UC1611S controller&lt;br&gt;
Interfaces: 3-wire SPI, 4-wire SPI, I2C&lt;br&gt;
Supply: 2.7-3.3V, 40-pin SIP 2.54mm&lt;br&gt;
Operating temp: -20..+70 C&lt;p&gt;
Source: &lt;a href="https://www.lcd-module.com/fileadmin/eng/pdf/grafik/dogxl240-7e.pdf"&gt;Datasheet (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;</description>
